- Animated takes are Playwright `recordVideo` of the live site:
  viewport 1920×1080, page zoom 150%, big 76 px orange cursor ring
  composited live, eased (cubic) cursor paths. The recorder emits
  1920×1080 @ 25 fps (CSS-pixel size — DSF 2 does not raise video
  resolution), so the animated beats are native 1080p, conformed
  to 30 fps in assembly. The stills remain 3840×2160.
- All takes, the terminal cast, segment renders, and the encode
  ran on aletheia-core under thermal discipline: segment encodes
  started only at ≤ 70 °C Tctl (starts measured 31–67 °C; encode
  bursts peaked ~85 °C and cooled between segments; 40.2 °C at
  pull time).

